        "original_id": "6ded8bed-8b80-5ba0-b716-e60a13f81ffe",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sam Cassell, Isaiah Thomas, Robert Horry, Rex Chapman\n- Teams: Minnesota Timberwolves, Phoenix Suns, Houston Rockets, Boston Celtics\n- Seasons: 1996–97 Phoenix Suns season, 2003–04 NBA season, 2004–05 Minnesota Timberwolves season\n- Awards: NBA All-Star Game, All-NBA Team, Eastern Conference first seed\n\nFacts:\n- The 1996–97 Phoenix Suns acquired Sam Cassell and Robert Horry from the Houston Rockets during the offseason and signed free agent Rex Chapman.\n- Sam Cassell was selected to the NBA All-Star Game and the All-NBA Team once, and both honors came in the 2003–04 season.\n- The 2004–05 NBA season was the 16th season for the Minnesota Timberwolves in the National Basketball Association.\n- Isaiah Thomas was acquired by the Boston Celtics in February 2015.\n- Isaiah Thomas earned NBA All-Star selections in 2016 and 2017.\n- Isaiah Thomas received All-NBA Team honors in 2017 after leading the Boston Celtics to the first seed in the Eastern Conference.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
