        "text": "Page: 2004–05 Minnesota Timberwolves season. Sentence: The 2004–05 NBA season was the 16th season for the Minnesota Timberwolves in the National Basketball Association.\nPage: Sam Cassell. Sentence: He was selected to the NBA All-Star Game and All-NBA Team once, both in the 2003–04 season.\nPage: 1996–97 Phoenix Suns season. Sentence: During the offseason, the Suns acquired Sam Cassell and Robert Horry from the Houston Rockets, and signed free agent Rex Chapman.\nPage: Isaiah Thomas (basketball). Sentence: Thomas was acquired by the Boston Celtics in February 2015 and went on to earn NBA All-Star nods in 2016 and 2017, as well as All-NBA Team honors in 2017 after leading the Celtics to the first seed in the Eastern Conference.",
